### Капитан не запускает турнир (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/start
Authorization: Basic {{captain}} Captain2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Начать турнир (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/start
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

> {% client.global.set("matchId", response.body.matches[0].id); %}

